{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/481b6550df9050ecda901314e07cb2a4.poster.avif?t=1761321694\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/481b6550df9050ecda901314e07cb2a4.webm?t=1761321694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/481b6550df9050ecda901314e07cb2a4.mp4?t=1761321694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb your way to madness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your quest in a climbing game with roguelike elements and a cosmic horror style. Swing and launch yourself through ever-changing levels while obtaining Eyes, a mysterious currency that will alter the horrors perceived and the challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/3b51d356cf9e3c351b12d9c48054ad35.poster.avif?t=1761321694\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/3b51d356cf9e3c351b12d9c48054ad35.webm?t=1761321694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/3b51d356cf9e3c351b12d9c48054ad35.mp4?t=1761321694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Cool Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items are a big part of the game. Get them by looting corpses or buying them from the shop. Equip an item in each hand and find your favorite combo, but remember! You can't use an item if it's in the same hand you're holding on from. Passive items will offer respite and help you navigate levels as well. Aid your climb with these boons or curses\u2026 For better and for worse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/1c110fbd6a042ebe645786a2283ffa5d.poster.avif?t=1761321694\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/1c110fbd6a042ebe645786a2283ffa5d.webm?t=1761321694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/1c110fbd6a042ebe645786a2283ffa5d.mp4?t=1761321694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gain eyes to uncover horrors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the devious Mountain to deepen your knowledge of its secrets. Each level, enemy, and mechanic has 3 variations; the more Eyes you have, the harder the climb and the creepier the vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/f4ba720cb5618820ac2b15563e84a873.poster.avif?t=1761321694\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/f4ba720cb5618820ac2b15563e84a873.webm?t=1761321694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/f4ba720cb5618820ac2b15563e84a873.mp4?t=1761321694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the mountain, you might notice peculiar things like puzzles are hidden in every area. By solving them, you'll navigate memories, where you'll learn more about your character, the mountain and the cults that have spawned around it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you hear the Calling?</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Mountain is Calling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2645670/772e85985c7b5e0da09e851a8ce1b67d7b585057.jpg"},{"name":"No refunds!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2645670/009b10c0e8d79c042478e488140695273d32ed5a.jpg"},{"name":"Better get used to it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2645670/6b5bf040f640997dc4778d5544fbf785d9b06982.jpg"},{"name":"PhD in Zoology","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2645670/756dc32d2cc4e2d0c3241b372e14c01dbccb88b4.jpg"},{"name":"Loot Raider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2645670/9c09ae9ab491768afecdfc84a18f8e3f5bb565fa.jpg"},{"name":"Ancient Powers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2645670/08a190210b8ce43c0a61ace57d849456eb7e5846.jpg"},{"name":"Is that the time?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2645670/a04f917c81d2c653a4b2d89c2d27936600f6d7b7.jpg"},{"name":"Stone-shaped","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2645670/6207160e927a7ad11b50ddf6d43b9d463ec05caf.jpg"},{"name":"Timeless Perception","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2645670/9503febcf4e941aaae6b096b54b06d43ec5021e2.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond Knowledge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2645670/d5a65cfebf033855c30a7a2586baf8fdfabbe0dc.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2645670?t=1761321694","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/2e55d2964fff973d4191eb29d4e039242c485